00:00:03.188 --> 00:00:07.557
responses not a sequence you must follow Start with

00:00:07.583 --> 00:00:12.044
the specific action and its actual delegation Act within

00:00:12.070 --> 00:00:16.570
permission and conditions otherwise seek approval refer or decline

00:00:16.610 --> 00:00:17.531
and escalate


00:00:17.691 --> 00:00:22.296
Key takeaway Choose act seek approval refer or decline

00:00:22.349 --> 00:00:25.138
and escalate according to the exact action and its

00:00:25.191 --> 00:00:31.178
